A closed inline construct spanning a verse boundary

```
::: |
*Roses are red,
Violets are blue.*
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p><strong>Roses are red,<br>
Violets are blue.</strong></p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
a `b
c` d
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a <code>b
c</code> d</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
*Roses are red,
Violets are blue.*
And so are you.
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p><strong>Roses are red,<br>
Violets are blue.</strong><br>
And so are you.</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
*Roses are red,\
Violets are blue.*
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p><strong>Roses are red,<br>
Violets are blue.</strong></p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
*Roses are red,
  Violets are blue.*
:::
.
